      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "Based on the supplier invoice INV-2207 evidence: Line 1 total = 360 (3 x 120), Line 2 total = 90 (2 x 45). Sum of line items = 450. The invoice header states a total due of 520. Since 450 does not equal 520, the claim that the total due equals the sum of its line items is not supported by the evidence.",
          "content_hash": "0x288ccd22ebb8e8d7c0f022cb20add9e265984d89706910a267c4f87c2fe688a8",
          "created_at_ms": 1793231649083,
          "message_id": "44033e21-5439-4ea6-b2fa-2b6406d0bf85",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-3",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Analysis of invoice INV-2207: Line 1 (Pallet wrap) = 3 x 120 = 360. Line 2 (Corner boards) = 2 x 45 = 90. Sum of line items = 360 + 90 = 450. The invoice header states a total due of 520. Therefore, 520 does NOT equal the sum of line items (450). The claim is factually unsupported.",
          "content_hash": "0xdab3ee31ddc92dd02e7c956bcdbbecde56750d3182df1d100654f73a55c8f660",
          "created_at_ms": 1793231657223,
          "message_id": "8ad8956c-56f4-4629-bad2-d2bf3a0bbf45",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-1",
          "sequence": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "Invoice INV-2207 analysis: Line 1 = 3 \u00d7 120 = 360; Line 2 = 2 \u00d7 45 = 90; sum of line items = 450. The invoice header states total due = 520. Therefore 520 \u2260 450, and the claim that the total equals the sum of line items is factually false. I note the unexplained 70-unit discrepancy.",
          "content_hash": "0xaa516843956e667911ad13f40d259d1b77fa3c522de74ac6cf2aa09fb0da5829",
          "created_at_ms": 1793231657828,
          "message_id": "3b515b34-0c68-4082-84fd-012b42b10b94",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-2",
          "sequence": 3
        },
        {
